{"id":174138,"bangumiId":174138,"type":2,"name":"ロクでなし魔術講師と禁忌教典","name_cn":"不正经的魔术讲师与禁忌教典","date":"2017-04-04","year":"2017","region":"jp","platform":"TV","images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/200/pic/cover/l/b2/af/174138_0BOO7.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/cover/l/b2/af/174138_0BOO7.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/b2/af/174138_0BOO7.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/800/pic/cover/l/b2/af/174138_0BOO7.jpg","common":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/cover/l/b2/af/174138_0BOO7.jpg"},"summary":"厌恶魔术的魔术讲师所展开的叛逆英雄幻想剧！\r\n魔术与科学共同发展的世界——卢瓦佛斯。\r\n位于魔导大国·阿尔扎诺帝国南部的“阿尔扎诺帝国魔法学院”，是学习世界最先端魔术的最高学舍。\r\n拥有约四百年历史的这所学院，是所有有志于魔术之道人们的憧憬，学院的讲师和学生们也因自己的身份而自豪。\r\n突然来到这所正统学院赴任的非常勤讲师，格伦·勒达斯。\r\n“我来教给你们真正的魔术吧”\r\n被称作“不正经”的这个男人的破天荒授课，就此开始。","rating":{"rank":7187,"total":6028,"count":{"1":10,"2":19,"3":57,"4":231,"5":947,"6":2639,"7":1642,"8":359,"9":51,"10":73},"score":6.2},"collection":{"on_hold":353,"dropped":428,"wish":1234,"collect":11662,"doing":614},"tags":[{"name":"后宫","count":1290,"total_count":311231},{"name":"轻小说改","count":1222,"total_count":509242},{"name":"魔法","count":941,"total_count":20546},{"name":"2017年4月","count":920,"total_count":25969},{"name":"战斗","count":909,"total_count":489011},{"name":"校园","count":884,"total_count":470316},{"name":"TV","count":626,"total_count":1443518},{"name":"不正经的魔术讲师与禁忌教典","count":419,"total_count":419},{"name":"轻改","count":374,"total_count":155654},{"name":"LIDENFILMS","count":355,"total_count":14618},{"name":"奇幻","count":354,"total_count":491524},{"name":"2017","count":330,"total_count":72587},{"name":"搞笑","count":119,"total_count":656833},{"name":"小说改","count":102,"total_count":167499},{"name":"日本","count":72,"total_count":313485},{"name":"异世界","count":63,"total_count":273462}],"eps":12,"total_episodes":12,"aliases":["不正经的魔术讲师与禁忌教典","ロクでなし魔術講師と禁忌教典","Rokudenashi Majutsu Koushi to Akashic Records","Akashic Records of Bastard Magic Instructor","不三不四的幻术讲师与隐讳教典","不正经的魔法讲师与禁忌教典"],"sourceType":"bibliography","nsfw":false,"